elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"69f3db6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Pourquoi \u00e9tudier au Mali ? <\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2ae380e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2ae380e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\u00c9tudier sur la terre de Soundjata K\u00e9\u00efta offre de nombreux avantages et opportunit\u00e9s. L\u2019\u00e9ducation sup\u00e9rieure est accessible au Mali. Le co\u00fbt de la vie est abordable. Le Mali poss\u00e8de un patrimoine culturel et historique avec une diversit\u00e9 multi-ethnique. Le Mali est une destination id\u00e9ale pour une exp\u00e9rience inter \u2013 culturelle enrichissante. \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-85c4c88 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"85c4c88\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e9711e2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e9711e2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/Mali.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-49593\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/Mali.png 1024w, https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/Mali-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/Mali-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/Mali-768x768.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div clas